# EN: Copy to `.env.local` (Vite loads `.env` and `.env.local`). Do not commit `.env.local`.
# ES: Copia a `.env.local` (Vite carga `.env` y `.env.local`). No subas `.env.local` a git.
# EN: Only `VITE_*` goes to the client bundle; it exposes any `VITE_` value (never put secrets here).
# ES: Solo `VITE_*` va al bundle del cliente; se expone cualquier valor `VITE_` (nunca claves o mnemónicas).

# --- Paseo EVM (ZK Lab, Attestations) ---
VITE_PASEO_VERIFIER_ADDRESS=
VITE_PASEO_MERKLE_REGISTRY_ADDRESS=
VITE_PASEO_CHAIN_ID=420420417
VITE_PASEO_RPC_URL=https://eth-rpc-testnet.polkadot.io
VITE_PASEO_EXPLORER_URL=https://blockscout-testnet.polkadot.io

# --- Relay (gossip / WS) ---
# VITE_YOHUALLI_RELAY_WS=wss://…
# (Opcional) URL wss pública p. ej. en Railway: aparece como atajo en Atestaciones
# (Optional) Public wss e.g. Railway: shows as a quick-pick in Attestations
# VITE_YOHUALLI_RELAY_RAILWAY=wss://yohualli-….up.railway.app

# --- Lab: trusted seeds, optional circuits (optional) / semillas de confianza, circuitos (opcional) ---
# VITE_LAB_TRUSTED_SS58=…
# VITE_LAB_TRUSTED_EVM=…
# VITE_YOHUALLI_CIRCUIT_LAB_PK=0x…
# VITE_YOHUALLI_LAB_MERKLE_ROOT=0x…
# VITE_YOHUALLI_LAB_SUBJECT_SS58=…

# --- Dev (optional) ---
# VITE_PWA_DEV=0
# VITE_DEV_PLAIN_HTTP=0
# VITE_DEV_LAN_IP=
# VITE_BASE_URL=/

# EN: Barretenberg: Vite dev process only, not the browser bundle; see `vite.config` and `docs/CIRCUITS_LAB.md`.
# ES: Barretenberg: solo proceso de Vite en dev, no el bundle; ver `vite.config` y `docs/CIRCUITS_LAB.md`.
# export BB_MSGPACK_VITE_MIB=64
# EN: In shell, before `yarn dev`.  ES: En el shell, antes de `yarn dev`.
